# Third-Party Notices

`maple` is a **clean-room re-implementation**. No source code is copied or
vendored from the projects below. Their source is read as the specification:
behaviour and file/wire formats are reproduced 1:1 in freshly written Rust. All
code in this repository is written by maple contributors and licensed under MIT
(see `LICENSE`).

